<h1 class="tcs-policy-title">Refund and Returns Policy</h1>
<div class="entry-content">

		
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At The Coffee Sleeves, we stand behind the quality of our coffee sleeves and packaging accessories. Every sleeve is printed to order with your design, so we take back items that arrive defective, damaged or different from the proof you approved. Please read the policy below for how returns, replacements and refunds work.</p>
<hr />
<h3>Eligibility</h3>
<p>This return policy is valid for <strong>all orders placed and shipped within the United States</strong>.</p>
<hr />
<h3>Returns</h3>
<p>We accept returns for <strong>defective products only</strong>: items with a printing or manufacturing fault, items damaged in transit, or items that do not match your approved proof. The following conditions apply:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The defect must be reported with your order number and <strong>photos of the problem</strong>, and the items returned <strong>unused</strong> in their original packaging where possible.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>A return request must be submitted within <strong>10 days</strong> of receiving your order.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Returns are accepted <strong>by mail only</strong>. We do not allow drop-offs or in-person returns.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>A <strong>return shipping label is included in the package</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>No restocking fees are charged.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>To initiate a return, please email us at <a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" href="mailto:info@thecoffeesleeves.com" rel="noopener">info@thecoffeesleeves.com</a> with your order number, reason for return, and any supporting images if applicable.</p>
<hr />
<h3>Exchanges</h3>
<p>Instead of a refund you can ask for a free replacement of defective items. Replacements are printed and shipped once the return is received and approved.</p>
<hr />
<h3>Refunds</h3>
<p>After we receive and inspect your return:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Refunds are issued within <strong>10 business days</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Refunds will be made to your <strong>original payment method</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Refunds are processed in <strong>USD</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h3>Non-Returnable Items</h3>
<p>Please note, we do not accept returns for:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Items that are not defective, including custom-printed or custom-sized sleeves made exactly to an approved proof</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Used items or items damaged by the customer</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Orders returned after the 10-day period</p>
</li>
</ul>
